いします!!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@okamura3220/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cc8a910/uploads/origins/3db1d55b-98eb-4eaa-8b33-79dae4d0b00b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c2faaf9da017057eb5024feac17ae16", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2cc8a910/uploads/origins/3db1d55b-98eb-4eaa-8b33-79dae4d0b00b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c2faaf9da017057eb5024feac17ae16, https://si.imgix.net/2cc8a910/uploads/origins/3db1d55b-98eb-4eaa-8b33-79dae4d0b00b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbcecbb56777d63d17ec4a625f1d262f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2cc8a910/uploads/origins/3db1d55b-98eb-4eaa-8b33-79dae4d0b00b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22310ec5e4dcbad59ef9838e969190bb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは\n\n塩を司るドラゴンのイラストを描いて頂けないでしょうか？擬人化でも大丈夫です。\n\n塩を固めたような鱗で、溶けた塩の唾液が口から垂れて、口からプラズマ化した塩のブレスを放つとかそんな感じのやつです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@okamura3220/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/612fe3ed/uploads/origins/352fa673-63cc-427c-8f24-29831c2612f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=352db35be7dfab9b2f44c1b963d98b72", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/612fe3ed/uploads/origins/352fa673-63cc-427c-8f24-29831c2612f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=352db35be7dfab9b2f44c1b963d98b72, https://si.imgix.net/612fe3ed/uploads/origins/352fa673-63cc-427c-8f24-29831c2612f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5fbd65d8433c67adc6b7072595cfdf7d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/612fe3ed/uploads/origins/352fa673-63cc-427c-8f24-29831c2612f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b24a969c51561cf70c7707613855f76c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "梟の錬金術師ルナ・ゴールドレ